Lab 7: Implementing Asynchronous Messaging with ActiveMQ
Objectives
Integrate Apache Camel with Apache ActiveMQ for asynchronous message processing
Configure message queues and routing in Camel and ActiveMQ
Implement transactional message processing and testing
Prerequisites
Java JDK 11 or later installed
Apache Maven 3.6+ installed
Basic understanding of Java and messaging concepts
Access to a terminal/command prompt
Setup Requirements
Install ActiveMQ:
wget https://archive.apache.org/dist/activemq/5.16.3/apache-activemq-5.16.3-bin.tar.gz
tar xzf apache-activemq-5.16.3-bin.tar.gz
cd apache-activemq-5.16.3/bin
./activemq start
Verify ActiveMQ is running by accessing the admin console at: http://localhost:8161/admin (default credentials: admin/admin)
